Passage: DIR, Art. 5(1)

[0] Article 5 Placing on the market and putting into service.
[1] 1.
[2] Before placing machinery on the market and/or putting it into service, the manufacturer or his authorised representative shall:
[3] (a) ensure that it satisfies the relevant essential health and safety requirements set out in Annex I;
[4] (b) ensure that the technical file referred to in Annex VII, part A is available;
[5] (c) provide, in particular, the necessary information, such as instructions;
[6] (d) carry out the appropriate procedures for assessing conformity in accordance with Article 12;
[7] (e) draw up the EC declaration of conformity in accordance with Annex II, part 1, Section A and ensure that it accompanies the machinery;
[8] (f) affix the CE marking in accordance with Article 16.
